-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-1-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Airport Oaks\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-2\">\n                                <span class=\"area-dot\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-2-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Auckland Airport\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-3\">\n                                <span class=\"area-dot\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-3-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Clover Park\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-4\">\n                                <span class=\"area-dot\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-4-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Totara Heights\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-5\">\n                                <span class=\"area-dot\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-5-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Puhinui\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-6\">\n                                <span class=\"area-dot\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1-2-4-2-6-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Middlemore\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"final-cta\" data-kid=\"1-3-9\">\n            <div class=\"shell final-inner\" data-kid=\"1-3-9-1\">\n                <h2 data-kid=\"1-3-9-1-1\">\n                    Need a local plumber today?\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"final-side\" data-kid=\"1-3-9-1-2\">\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-3-9-1-2-1\">\n                        Fast help for leaks, hot water failures, blocked drains, gas issues and urgent plumbing jobs across Papatoetoe and South Auckland.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"final-actions\" data-kid=\"1-3-9-1-2-2\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-call btn-lg\" data-kid=\"1-3-9-1-2-2-1\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone icon icon-ink\" data-kid=\"1-3-9-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                            </i>\n                            Call now\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg\" data-kid=\"1-3-9-1-2-2-2\" data-request-trigger=\"\" href=\"#request-bay\">\n                            Request service\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"site-footer\" data-kid=\"1-4\">\n        <div class=\"shell footer-inner\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\">\n                <div class=\"footer-brand\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1\">\n                    Papatoetoe\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1-1\">\n                        Plumbing & Gas\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"footer-copy\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-2\">\n                    24/7 emergency plumbing, hot water and gas across Papatoetoe and South Auckland.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"footer-phone\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n                64 9 8844104\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n    <div class=\"mobile-dock-spacer\" data-kid=\"1-5\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mobile-dock\" data-kid=\"1-6\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-call\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone icon icon-ink\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1\">\n            </i>\n            Call now\n        </a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-navy\" data-kid=\"1-6-2\" data-request-trigger=\"\" href=\"#request-bay\">\n            Request service\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n    (() => {\n    const form = document.getElementById('request-form');\n    const serviceSelect = document.getElementById('service');\n    const selectedProblem = document.getElementById('selected-problem');\n    const requestBay = document.getElementById('request-bay');\n    const incidentRows = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-service][data-problem]')];\n    const serviceRows = [...document.querySelectorAll('.service-line[data-service]')];\n    const requestTriggers = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-request-trigger]')];\n    const setService = (service, problem) => {\n      if (serviceSelect) serviceSelect.value = service;\n      if (selectedProblem && problem) selectedProblem.textContent = problem;\n      incidentRows.forEach((row) => {\n        const isSelected = row.dataset.service === service;\n        row.classList.toggle('is-selected', isSelected);\n        row.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(isSelected));\n      });\n    };\n    incidentRows.forEach((row) => row.addEventListener('click', () => setService(row.dataset.service || '', row.dataset.problem || '')));\n    serviceRows.forEach((row) => row.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      setService(row.dataset.service || '', '');\n      requestBay?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n      window.setTimeout(() => serviceSelect?.focus(), 450);\n    }));\n    requestTriggers.forEach((trigger) => trigger.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      requestBay?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n      window.setTimeout(() => serviceSelect?.focus(), 450);\n    }));\n    const reviewToggle = document.querySelector('[data-review-toggle]');\n    const disclosure = document.getElementById('review-disclosure');\n    reviewToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const open = disclosure?.classList.toggle('is-open') || false;\n      reviewToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));\n      disclosure?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!open));\n      const icon = reviewToggle.querySelector('i');\n      if (icon) icon.className = open ? 'ti ti-arrow-up icon' : 'ti ti-arrow-down icon';\n    });\n    form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      const status = document.getElementById('form-status');\n      if (status) status.textContent = 'Request sent. We’ll call you back shortly. For urgent problems, call 64 9 8844104.';\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-29T01:58:56.605965+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-29T02:00:27.548070+00:00",
