1-1\" data-name=\"phone call icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    Call now\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"header-request\" data-anchor-request=\"\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"request service link\" href=\"#request-service\">\n                    Request service\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main data-kid=\"2-3\" data-name=\"page content\">\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" class=\"hero\" data-kid=\"2-3-1\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n            <div class=\"wrap hero-inner\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"hero section content wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"hero-copy\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero text container\">\n                    <p class=\"hero-kicker\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero kicker text\">\n                        Papatoetoe & South Auckland plumbing and gas\n                    </p>\n                    <h1 data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero headline\" id=\"hero-title\">\n                        Papatoetoe plumber for urgent leaks, drains, hot water & gas.\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"hero-lede\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"hero lede text\">\n                        Call now for urgent help. Request service if you’d prefer a callback from a qualified local plumber.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"hero-actions\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-4\" data-name=\"hero action buttons container\">\n                        <a class=\"call-button hero-call\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"hero call button\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone-call\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"phone call icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Call now · 64 9 8844104\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"hero-request\" data-anchor-request=\"\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"hero request service link\" href=\"#request-service\">\n                            Request service\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-down-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"down arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"hero-note\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-5\" data-name=\"hero alert note\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-alert-circle\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-5-1\" data-name=\"alert icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        For burst pipes, overflowing toilets, ceiling leaks or urgent water shutoffs, call rather than waiting for a callback.\n                    </p>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Service commitments\" class=\"hero-proof\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-6\" data-name=\"service commitments list\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-6-1\" data-name=\"commitment one\">\n                            Qualified & insured\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-6-2\" data-name=\"commitment two\">\n                            Clear pricing before work\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-6-3\" data-name=\"commitment three\">\n                            Papatoetoe & South Auckland\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <section aria-labelledby=\"record-title\" class=\"contact-record\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"contact record form section\" id=\"request-service\">\n                    <div class=\"record-head\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"record head container\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"contact record eyebrow\">\n                            Contact record\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"contact record title\" id=\"record-title\">\n                            Need help now?\n                        </h2>\n                        <a class=\"record-phone\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"record phone number link\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone-call\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"phone icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            64 9 8844104\n                        </a>\n                        <p class=\"record-sub\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"contact record description\">\n                            24/7 emergency plumbing, hot water and gas across South Auckland.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"record-body\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"record body container\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"record body title\">\n                            Request service\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"record-intro\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"record intro text\">\n                            Leave your number and a short description. We’ll call you back.\n                        </p>\n                        <form class=\"form-grid\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"service request form\" id=\"request-form\">\n                            <div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"service choice field group\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"service choice label\" for=\"record-service\">\n                                    What do you need?\n                                </label>\n                                <select data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"service choice select menu\" id=\"record-service\" name=\"service\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"emergency service option\">\n                                        Emergency plumbing\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"leak repair option\">\n                                        Leak repairs\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"blocked drain option\">\n                                        Blocked drains\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"hot water option\">\n                                        Hot water\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2-5\" data-name=\"gas fitting option\">\n                                        Gas fitting\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2-6\" data-name=\"bathroom fixture option\">\n                                        Bathrooms & fixtures\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-1-2-7\" data-name=\"other service option\">\n                                        Other (describe if not listed)\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-pair\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"form input pair container\">\n                                <div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"name field group\">\n                                    <label data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"name label\" for=\"record-name\">\n                                        Name\n                                    </label>\n                                    <input autocomplete=\"name\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"name input\" id=\"record-name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\" required=\"\"/>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"phone field group\">\n                                    <label data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"phone label\" for=\"record-phone\">\n                                        Phone\n                                    </label>\n                                    <input autocomplete=\"tel\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"phone input\" id=\"record-phone\" name=\"phone\" placeholder=\"021 123 4567\" required=\"\" type=\"tel\"/>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"suburb field group\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"suburb label\" for=\"record-suburb\">\n                                    Suburb\n                                    <em data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"optional tag\">\n                                        optional\n                                    </em>\n                                </label>\n                                <input autocomplete=\"address-level2\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"suburb input\" id=\"record-suburb\" name=\"suburb\" placeholder=\"e.g. Papatoetoe\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"details field group\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"details label\" for=\"record-details\">\n                                    Details\n                                    <em data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"optional tag\">\n                                        optional\n                                    </em>\n                                </label>\n                                <textarea data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"details textarea\" id=\"record-details\" name=\"details\" placeholder=\"Tell us what’s happening\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"selected-note\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-5\" data-name=\"selected service display note\" data-reason=\"text replaced by selection script\" hidden=\"\" id=\"selected-service-note\">\n                            </p>\n                            <button class=\"record-submit\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-6\" data-name=\"submit button\" type=\"submit\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-send\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-3-6-1\" data-name=\"send icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Send request\n                            </button>\n                        </form>\n                        <p class=\"record-trust\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"privacy trust text group\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"shield icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"privacy statement\">\n                                Your details stay private. We’ll confirm the job details and timing by phone.\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"record-urgent\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"urgent call text\">\n                            For urgent problems, call\n                            <a data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"urgent phone link\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n                                64 9 8844104\n                            </a>\n                            .\n                        </p>\n                        <p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"record-trust\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2-6\" data-name=\"form submission status\" data-reason=\"content replaced by submission script\" hidden=\"\" id=\"form-status\">\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"before-title\" class=\"process\" data-kid=\"2-3-2\" data-name=\"process steps section\">\n            <div class=\"wrap process-layout\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"process layout grid\">\n                <div class=\"rule-heading\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"section header group\">\n                    <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"eyebrow text\">\n                        Before work starts\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section title\" id=\"before-title\">\n                        A straightforward service record.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"section-copy\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"section copy\">\n                        The goal is simple: understand the problem, explain the options, and leave the work tidy.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"commitments grid\">\n                    <div class=\"commitments\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"commitments list\">\n                        <article class=\"commitment\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"first commitment\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-badge-check\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"badge check icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"commitment title\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"commitment heading\">\n                                    Qualified, insured, guaranteed workmanship\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"commitment description\">\n                                    Gas and plumbing work handled by qualified tradespeople and backed by workmanship standards.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"commitment\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"second commitment\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-receipt-2\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"receipt icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"commitment title\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"commitment heading\">\n                                    Clear advice before work starts\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"commitment description\">\n                                    Know what is happening before a repair or installation gets underway.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"commitment\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"third commitment\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-list-check\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"list check icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"commitment title\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"commitment heading\">\n                                    Practical repair options\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"commitment description\">\n                                    Get sensible choices for the job, without vague callout surprises.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"commitment\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"fourth commitment\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-sparkles\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"sparkles icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"commitment title\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"commitment heading\">\n                                    Tidy permanent fixes\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"commitment description\">\n                                    Repairs are completed with attention to the finish, not just the immediate symptom.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-label=\"What happens after contacting us\" class=\"sequence\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"service sequence flow\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step one label\">\n                            Call or request service\n                        </strong>\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"step two label\">\n                            We confirm the job details\n                        </span>\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"step three label\">\n                            Work and pricing are discussed before work starts\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"reviews-title\" class=\"proof-section\" data-kid=\"2-3-3\" data-name=\"reviews section\" id=\"reviews\">\n            <div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"reviews section layout\">\n                <div class=\"proof-header\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"reviews header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"reviews section titles\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"eyebrow text\">\n                            What customers mention\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section title\" id=\"reviews-title\">\n                            5-star local plumbing service.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-label=\"5.0 on Google, 9 reviews\" class=\"google-proof\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"google rating summary\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"google-stars\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"star rating icons\">\n                            ★★★★★\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"google-proof-text\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"rating count text\">\n                            5.0 on Google\n                            <small data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"total reviews count\">\n                                9 reviews\n                            </small>\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"review-ledger\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"reviews list container\">\n                    <article class=\"review review-feature\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"featured review\">\n                        <p class=\"review-claim\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"review category label\">\n                            Clear pricing\n                        </p>\n                        <div aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" class=\"stars\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"stars rating icons\">\n                            ★★★★★\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"quote\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"review quote\">\n                            “From the first contact they were responsive, professional and very clear about pricing. The plumber arrived on time, diagnosed the issue quickly and completed the job to a very high standard.”\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"review-meta\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"review meta container\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"reviewer name\">\n                                Cesar Gil\n                            </strong>\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"review date location\">\n                                Papatoetoe · 3 days ago\n                            </span>\n                            <em data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"review description\">\n                                Outdoor plumbing system repair\n                            </em>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"review\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"standard review one\">\n                        <p class=\"review-claim\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"review category label\">\n                            Tidy work\n                        </p>\n                        <div aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" class=\"stars\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"stars rating icons\">\n                            ★★★★★\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"quote\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"review quote\">\n                            “Super duper guy to deal with. On time. No mess left. Very mannerly and his price was on fleck too. Highly recommend Sam.”\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"review-meta\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"review meta container\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"reviewer name\">\n                                Gary Mcentee\n                            </strong>\n                            <span data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"review date location\">\n                                Papatoetoe · 1 week ago\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"review\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"standard review two\">\n                        <p class=\"review-claim\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"review category label\">\n                            Prompt service\n                        </p>\n                        <div aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" class=\"stars\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"stars rating icons\">\n                            ★★★★★\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"quote\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"review quote\">\n                            “Did a fantastic job fixing up a leak underneath our floor. Arrived on time and job was done to a high standard - good price too! Cheers mate.”\n                        </