rk-title\">\n                            Real jobs, tidy finishes.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"work-intro\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"work intro text\">\n                        A small sample of the plumbing work completed across Papatoetoe and nearby South Auckland suburbs.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"evidence-spread\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2\" data-name=\"evidence spread grid\">\n                    <figure class=\"evidence-card\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"first evidence card\">\n                        <img alt=\"Completed Papatoetoe plumbing repair with tidy pipework\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"evidence image\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/src/assets/unnamed-11.jpeg\" width=\"480\"/>\n                        <figcaption class=\"evidence-caption\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"evidence caption container\">\n                            <span class=\"evidence-index\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"work index label\">\n                                Work 01\n                            </span>\n                            <p data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"work description\">\n                                Completed Papatoetoe plumbing repair with tidy pipework.\n                            </p>\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                    <figure class=\"evidence-card evidence-card-offset\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"second evidence card\">\n                        <img alt=\"Before and after plumbing project photo in South Auckland\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"evidence image\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1020\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/src/assets/unnamed-6.jpeg\" width=\"765\"/>\n                        <figcaption class=\"evidence-caption\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"evidence caption container\">\n                            <span class=\"evidence-index\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"work index label\">\n                                Work 02\n                            </span>\n                            <p data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"work description\">\n                                Before and after plumbing project photo in South Auckland.\n                            </p>\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"areas-title\" class=\"areas\" data-kid=\"2-3-6\" data-name=\"service areas section\" id=\"areas\">\n            <div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1\" data-name=\"areas content wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"areas-header\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-1\" data-name=\"areas header group\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"eyebrow text\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"eyebrow\">\n                            Service areas\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section title\" id=\"areas-title\">\n                            Papatoetoe and South Auckland.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"areas-copy\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"areas intro text\">\n                        Papatoetoe is home base, with service across the surrounding suburbs listed below.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"area-register\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2\" data-name=\"areas register grid\">\n                    <div class=\"area-group\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"papatoetoe group\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"group title\">\n                            Papatoetoe\n                        </h3>\n                        <ul data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"suburbs list\">\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Papatoetoe\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Manukau\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Mangere\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Mangere East\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-5\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Otara\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-6\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Flat Bush\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-7\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                East Tamaki\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-8\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Otahuhu\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-1-2-9\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Favona\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"area-group\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"further south group\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"group title\">\n                            Further south\n                        </h3>\n                        <ul data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"suburbs list\">\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Wiri\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Takanini\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Papakura\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Manurewa\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-5\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Clendon Park\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-6\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Randwick Park\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-7\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Goodwood Heights\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-2-2-8\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Hillpark\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"area-group\" data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"airport nearby group\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"group title\">\n                            Airport & nearby\n                        </h3>\n                        <ul data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"suburbs list\">\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                The Gardens\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Airport Oaks\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Auckland Airport\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Clover Park\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2-5\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Totara Heights\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2-6\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Puhinui\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"2-3-6-1-2-3-2-7\" data-name=\"suburb item\">\n                                Middlemore\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\" class=\"cta-band\" data-kid=\"2-3-7\" data-name=\"cta band section\">\n            <div class=\"wrap cta-inner\" data-kid=\"2-3-7-1\" data-name=\"cta content wrapper\">\n                <div data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-1\" data-name=\"cta text group\">\n                    <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"eyebrow text\">\n                        Need help with a plumbing or gas problem?\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"cta title\" id=\"cta-title\">\n                        Call now for urgent help, or request service for a callback.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cta-actions\" data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-2\" data-name=\"cta actions container\">\n                    <a class=\"call-button\" data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"call button\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone-call\" data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"phone call icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Call 64 9 8844104\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"secondary-cta\" data-anchor-request=\"\" data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"secondary cta link\" href=\"#request-service\">\n                        Request service\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-7-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"footer\" data-kid=\"2-4\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n        <div class=\"wrap footer-inner\" data-kid=\"2-4-1\" data-name=\"footer content wrapper\">\n            <div data-kid=\"2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand text container\">\n                <div class=\"footer-brand\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">\n                    Papatoetoe Plumbing & Gas\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"footer-copy\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer disclaimer text\">\n                    24/7 emergency plumbing, hot water and gas across Papatoetoe and South Auckland.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"footer-phone\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"footer phone number link\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n                64 9 8844104\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n    <div aria-label=\"Quick contact\" class=\"mobile-dock\" data-kid=\"2-5\" data-name=\"mobile quick contact dock\">\n        <a class=\"dock-call\" data-kid=\"2-5-1\" data-name=\"mobile dock call button\" href=\"tel:+6498844104\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone-call\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"phone icon\">\n            </i>\n            Call now\n        </a>\n        <a class=\"dock-request\" data-anchor-request=\"\" data-kid=\"2-5-2\" data-name=\"mobile dock request link\" href=\"#request-service\">\n            Request service\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n    (() => {\n    const request = document.querySelector('#request-service');\n    const form = document.querySelector('#request-form');\n    const serviceSelect = document.querySelector('#record-service');\n    const selectedNote = document.querySelector('#selected-service-note');\n    const formStatus = document.querySelector('#form-status');\n\n    const scrollToRequest = () => {\n      request?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n      window.setTimeout(() => document.querySelector('#record-name')?.focus(), 450);\n    };\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-anchor-request]').forEach((link) => {\n      link.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\n        event.preventDefault();\n        scrollToRequest();\n      });\n    });\n\n    const setService = (value) => {\n      if (serviceSelect) serviceSelect.value = value;\n      if (selectedNote) {\n        selectedNote.hidden = false;\n        selectedNote.textContent = `Selected service: ${value}`;\n      }\n    };\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-accordion]').forEach((trigger) => {\n      trigger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const isOpen = trigger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';\n        document.querySelectorAll('[data-accordion]').forEach((other) => {\n          other.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n          const panel = document.getElementById(other.getAttribute('aria-controls'));\n          if (panel) panel.hidden = true;\n        });\n        if (!isOpen) {\n          trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n          const panel = document.getElementById(trigger.getAttribute('aria-controls'));\n          if (panel) panel.hidden = false;\n        }\n      });\n    });\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-service]').forEach((button) => {\n      button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        setService(button.dataset.service || 'Other (describe if not listed)');\n        scrollToRequest();\n      });\n    });\n\n    const reviewToggle = document.querySelector('[data-review-toggle]');\n    const reviewMore = document.querySelector('#review-more');\n    reviewToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const open = reviewToggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';\n      reviewToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!open));\n      if (reviewMore) reviewMore.hidden = open;\n      const icon = reviewToggle.querySelector('.ti');\n      if (icon) icon.className = open ? 'ti ti-chevron-down' : 'ti ti-chevron-up';\n    });\n\n    form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      if (formStatus) {\n        formStatus.hidden = false;\n        formStatus.innerHTML = '<i class=\"ti ti-circle-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Request sent. We’ll call you back shortly. For urgent problems, call <a href=\"tel:+6498844104\">64 9 8844104</a>.</span>';\n      }\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n",
